			"Message": "build(deps): bump protobufjs from 8.4.1 to 8.4.2\n\nBumps [protobufjs](https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js) from 8.4.1 to 8.4.2.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/protobufjs/protobuf.js/compare/protobufjs-v8.4.1...protobufjs-v8.4.2)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: protobufjs\n  dependency-version: 8.4.2\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>",
			"SHA": "6dda738f19ae88fcb1bd0817606619df423b7cc2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-22T08:39:06Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠁⠀⠀⠀",
				1208,
				264
			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Minify ESBuild configs and add Bootstrap bundle\n\nMinify all Configuration/ESBuild/*.js, Configuration/Mountain/Config.js, and Source/ESBuild.js from pretty-printed tab-indented format to single-line compact form. This reduces their footprint in the Configuration/ directory and prevents config-only modules from inflating source map coverage reports.\n\nAdd a new Bootstrap ESBuild configuration under Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Config/Bootstrap/Config.ts that inlines every npm dependency into a single self-contained bundle. Unlike the Target build which uses packages:external, the Bootstrap bundle is deployed inside the .app at Contents/Resources/Cocoon/Target/Bootstrap/Implementation/Cocoon/Main.js where no node_modules directory exists. All Cocoon runtime deps (effect, @grpc/grpc-js, …) are pure JavaScript, making full inlining safe — only Node.js built-ins (node:*) and the vscode/electron stubs are kept external.\n\nWire BootstrapConfig through the ESBuild index.ts re-export and add its build step to prepublishOnly.sh.\n\nRegenerate the RouteManifest timestamp (2026-05-22T08:30:17Z) and rebuild all Target/ compiled artifacts to reflect the reformatted configuration sources. 388 Mountain RPC methods registered, 0 bespoke routes.",
			"SHA": "6fcf0a02cb21132000ce5de730bfb7b0018241b0"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-22T07:49:53Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1173,
				41
			],
			"Message": "style(Cocoon): Normalise config JS to tab indentation with trailing commas\n\nRestore tab indentation across all Configuration/ESBuild/*.js, Configuration/Mountain/Config.js, and Source/ESBuild.js, reversing the 2-space normalisation from the previous style pass (3bc8d83). Alongside the indentation change:\n\n- Restore trailing commas to all array and object literals across every config file.\n- Reorder imports so re-exports (`export *`) appear before local imports in Cocoon.js and index.js, matching the convention used by sibling config files.\n- Flatten Environment Constant.js named exports to a single-line block.\n- Wrap `__name` helper calls and long template expressions with consistent multi-line formatting at soft line widths (Compile Config.js, Mountain Config.js).\n\nRegenerate the RouteManifest timestamp (2026-05-22T07:31:17Z) and rebuild all Target/ compiled artifacts to reflect the reformatted configuration sources. No functional changes to build logic, RPC method registration (still 135 Mountain methods), or runtime behaviour.",
			"SHA": "7a468ec779910c9ba74090f444f30ffed6ec766f"
		}
	],
